### Temu Ads 管理后台接口测试

@temuAccessToken = replace-with-temu-access-token
@goodsId = 123456789
@startTs = 1767225600000
@endTs = 1767311999999

### 查询推荐 ROAS
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/roas/predict
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "goodsInfoList": [{ "goodsId": {{goodsId}} }]
}

### 查询店铺广告报表
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/reports/mall
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "startTs": {{startTs}},
  "endTs": {{endTs}}
}

### 查询商品广告报表
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/reports/goods
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "goodsId": {{goodsId}},
  "startTs": {{startTs}},
  "endTs": {{endTs}}
}

### 创建广告
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "createAdReqs": [{
    "goodsId": {{goodsId}},
    "roas": 3.5,
    "roasType": 1,
    "budget": 20
  }]
}

### 查询广告详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/details
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "goodsIds": [{{goodsId}}]
}

### 查询广告日志
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "goodsId": {{goodsId}},
  "startTime": {{startTs}},
  "endTime": {{endTs}}
}

### 查询商品是否可创建广告
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/goods/creatable
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "goodsIds": [{{goodsId}}]
}

### 修改广告预算
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/ads/modify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "status": 4,
  "modifyAdDTO": {
    "goodsId": {{goodsId}},
    "budget": 30
  }
}
